  "scope_boundaries": [
    "Native positive admission/retirement witnesses are exact-zero held poses at authored gravity0 in valid packed stable material. They retain compound six-shape payload mass520/native inertia; they do not demonstrate nonzero-catch efficacy or production rest.",
    "Native nonquiet nonzero prepared-wrench preservation is a separate direct-API control.",
    "Actual Rapier tests apply synthetic versioned receipts and measure correction/zeroing, one delivered J/L pair, delta-v=J/m, delta-omega=L/I and kinetic boundaries. They do not imply that native catch was admitted during gameplay.",
    "Whole-world census tests use the actual paused exclusive owner, four same-tick tiles, immutable copied replies, native/detached payload accounting and integer Water quantity; zero Rapier steps.",
    "Bounds/UI tests cover64 acceptance,64.01 and friction4.01 refusal, staged controls and fresh ownership; async tests use real publication/echo/ack with zero physics steps.",
    "Early181-labelled fixture checks had explicitly recorded GDScript fixture deltas; final594 acquisition-project reruns verify the committed final scripts with the unchanged181 runtimes.",
    "Mechanical counts are assertions within their scopes, not independent efficacy populations. No whole-system energy, sleep change, production default, subjective acceptance or merge is established."
